	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08pc0101_gentleman_01w"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ときどき　おもうんだがね▼
わたしと　そっくりな　にんげんが
まったく　べつの　いきかたをする……▽
そんな　せかいが　あるんじゃないかと</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-03T03:43:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ときどき　思うんだがね▼
わたしと　そっくりな　人間が
まったく　別の　生き方をする……▽
そんな　世界が　あるんじゃないかと</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-03T03:43:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・White2ver
※swanでメッセージ修正予定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:08:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GENTLEMAN
紳士</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08pc0101_gentleman_01b"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まったく　おなじ　にんげんでも
すむ　せかいに　よっては▽
おおきく　かわるのだろうな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-03T03:43:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>まったく　同じ　人間でも
住む　世界に　よっては▽
大きく　変わるのだろうな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-03T03:43:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・Black2ver
※swanでメッセージ修正予定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:08:33" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GENTLEMAN
紳士</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
